<em>Frequently Asked Questions</em></strong></span></h3>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-97950a91 gb-headline-text\"><h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"1nlecbm\" data-start=\"39\" data-end=\"96\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>Q1. When did the Railway RRB Junior Engineer JE CEN 04/2026 Online Application Process Start?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"97\" data-end=\"178\">The online application process started on <strong data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"743\">14 August 2026</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"1e84k3r\" data-start=\"435\" data-end=\"474\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>Q2.</strong><strong>What is the Exam Date for Railway RRB Junior Engineer JE CEN 04/2026?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"475\" data-end=\"553\">The Examination will be conducted in <b>As per Schedule RRB</b></li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>Q3. Where can I find the syllabus for the Railway RRB Junior Engineer JE CEN 04/2026 Examination?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">The detailed syllabus and examination scheme are available in the official notification. Candidates are advised to read the notification carefully for complete details.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>Q4. How can I download the Railway RRB Junior Engineer JE CEN 04/2026 Notification PDF?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">Candidates can download the notification through SarkariResult.com.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"kyy6a2\" data-start=\"180\" data-end=\"221\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>Q5. What is the last date to apply online for Railway RRB Junior Engineer JE CEN 04/2026?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"222\" data-end=\"305\">The last date to apply online is <strong>13 September 2026.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"1dih1sd\" data-start=\"307\" data-end=\"359\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>Q6. What is the last date to pay the application fee?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"360\" data-end=\"433\">Candidates can pay the application fee up to <strong data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"758\">13 September 2026</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>Q7. How can I apply for Railway RRB Junior Engineer JE CEN 04/2026?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">Candidates can apply online through the official recruitment link available on <strong data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1334\">SarkariResult.com (Since 2012) – Official Website of Sarkari Result®</strong>\n<p></p><figure id=\"attachment_27159\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-27159\" style=\"width: 1282px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-27159\" title=\"Railway RRB Junior Engineer JE CEN 04/2026 Recruitment 2026\" src=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/RRB-Junior-Engineer-JE.jpg\" alt=\"RRB Junior Engineer JE\" width=\"1292\" height=\"755\" srcset=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/RRB-Junior-Engineer-JE.jpg 1292w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/RRB-Junior-Engineer-JE-300x175.jpg 300w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/RRB-Junior-Engineer-JE-1024x598.jpg 1024w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/RRB-Junior-Engineer-JE-768x449.jpg 768